<%- include('../layouts/company-top', { title: '문의하기', active: 'contact' }) %>

<!-- Page Banner -->
<div class="page-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>문의하기</h1>
    <p>문의 내용을 남겨주시면 전문 담당자가 신속하게 답변드립니다</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section-py">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row g-5">

      <!-- Form -->
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-7">
        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-1" style="font-size:1.4rem;">견적 및 기술 문의</h2>
        <p class="text-em-muted small mb-4">모든 항목을 입력하신 후 문의 보내기를 눌러주세요.</p>

        <% if (typeof success !== 'undefined' && success) { %>
          <div class="alert alert-success mb-3" role="alert">
            ✓ 문의가 성공적으로 접수되었습니다. 빠른 시일 내 답변드리겠습니다.
          </div>
        <% } %>
        <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
          <div class="alert alert-danger mb-3" role="alert"><%= error %></div>
        <% } %>

        <form id="inquiryForm" class="d-grid gap-3" method="post" action="/contact">
          <div class="row g-3">
            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
              <label class="form-label" for="inq-name">이름 <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
              <input id="inq-name" name="name" class="form-control" required maxlength="50" placeholder="성함을 입력해주세요">
            </div>
            <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
              <label class="form-label" for="inq-email">이메일 <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
              <input id="inq-email" name="email" type="email" class="form-control" required placeholder="example@company.com">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="form-label" for="inq-msg">문의 내용 <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
            <textarea id="inq-msg" name="message" class="form-control" rows="6" required
              placeholder="제품명, 소재, 규격, 수량 등 구체적으로 작성해 주시면 더 빠른 답변이 가능합니다."></textarea>
          </div>

          <div>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="me-2" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M22 2L11 13M22 2l-7 20-4-9-9-4 20-7z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
              문의 보내기
            </button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <!-- Info -->
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-5">
        <div class="card p-4 mb-4">
          <h5 class="fw-bold mb-3">안내 사항</h5>
          <ul class="list-unstyled text-em-muted small mb-0 d-grid gap-2">
            <li class="d-flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-em-blue flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span>문의 등록 후 관리자가 대시보드에서 답변합니다.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="d-flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-em-blue flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span>필요 시 이메일로 답변과 파일 링크를 전송할 수 있습니다.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="d-flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-em-blue flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span>평균 답변 시간: 영업일 기준 1~2일 이내</span>
            </li>
            <li class="d-flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-em-blue flex-shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span>긴급 문의는 전화로 연락 주시면 즉시 대응합니다.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-4">
          <h5 class="fw-bold mb-3">연락처</h5>
          <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0 d-grid gap-3">
            <li class="d-flex gap-3 align-items-start">
              <div class="icon-circle bg-blue-pale text-em-blue flex-shrink-0" style="width:40px;height:40px;">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 013.07 9.82 19.79 19.79 0 01.01 1.18 2 2 0 012 0h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.13 1 .37 1.97.72 2.9a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L6.09 7.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.18-1.18a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.93.35 1.9.6 2.9.72A2 2 0 0122 14.92v2z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="fw-semibold small text-em-muted">전화</div>
                <div class="fw-bold">02-0000-0000</div>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="d-flex gap-3 align-items-start">
              <div class="icon-circle bg-blue-pale text-em-blue flex-shrink-0" style="width:40px;height:40px;">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12a2 2 0 01-2 2H4a2 2 0 01-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M22 6l-10 7L2 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="fw-semibold small text-em-muted">이메일</div>
                <div class="fw-bold">contact@enermade.com</div>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="d-flex gap-3 align-items-start">
              <div class="icon-circle bg-blue-pale text-em-blue flex-shrink-0" style="width:40px;height:40px;">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7zm0 9.5a2.5 2.5 0 010-5 2.5 2.5 0 010 5z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="fw-semibold small text-em-muted">주소</div>
                <div class="fw-bold">서울특별시 강남구 테헤란로 123</div>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<%- include('../layouts/company-bottom') %>
